{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751320/extras/a33acad222756f62ebc61b6208dc160f.avif?t=1732788504\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Line sticker : 28413420</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751320/extras/7c242d5641f0d15b116f039abb50b19c.avif?t=1732788504\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prologue is Free to play!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Echo&quot; Demo version may play the prologue (2+ hours of gameplay). <br>If the game interests you, please consider purchasing the Complete Version  <br>where you can transfer your cleared-game data and get a Prologue Clear Bonus! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you have enjoyed this title thus far,<br>please support us by purchasing the Complete Version.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751320/extras/729a57a2ced4d4231ffd3d3534d6a8a3.avif?t=1732788504\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone believes there is another world out there other than the one we live on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That such world is called &quot;Eveross,&quot; but no one has ever foundt this separate world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Searching for this other world is one of the reasons that has been firing up adventurers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of exploring the unknown along with Lin, a young adventurer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treck onward with your travel buddy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep pushing forward without forgetting the reason why you started</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >even if you run in a thicket of thorns?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751320/extras/c0733354ed0da7853ad74cf06dc40f47.avif?t=1732788504\" width=600 height=100 /></span>This title has several difficulty levels. <br>Story lovers can progress smoothly without being held back by difficult battles,  <br>but action lovers can still challenge themselves to tough fights by mastering their strategies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751320/extras/9fc7ef2b67bb1728f158486c3afae2f7.avif?t=1732788504\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Protagonist growth occurs with each boss taken down, <br>but it is up to you as to whether that growth is had specializing in attack, healing, or training. <br>How you handle boss battles affects your growth. <br>Tackle them using various skills and maneuvers,  <br>and you will see how all that greatly influences the progression path you take. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751320/extras/b95fb74bcc05d30dffec67ef2e44393f.avif?t=1732788504\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Gather materials to make tools and strengthen your equipment. <br>There are even puzzles and mini-games to challenge your mind aside from battles.  <br>Enjoy the rich side-stories and speedrun elements.  <br>Try to obtain all the trophies by tackling each thing one after another!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"cb07af7cff563e9bd2366c92385128cab95402df.jpg","localized_name":"The journey begins","name":"The journey begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/751320/cb07af7cff563e9bd2366c92385128cab95402df.jpg"},{"icon":"44ca